# 经典系统动力学原型：品牌资产飞轮（Brand Equity，营销教科书公有领域模型）
graph "品牌资产飞轮"

var ad_spend "广告投放"
var ad_effect "广告边际效果"
var awareness "品牌认知"
var sales "销售额"
var budget "营销预算"
var wom "口碑推荐"

ad_spend -> + ad_effect @loops R1
ad_effect -> + awareness @loops R1,B1
awareness -> + sales @loops R1,R2
sales -> + budget @loops R1
budget -> + ad_spend @loops R1
sales -> + wom @loops R2
wom -> + awareness @loops R2
awareness -> - ad_effect @loops B1

loop R1 "广告增长回路" "R" [ad_spend, ad_effect, awareness, sales, budget]
loop R2 "口碑增强回路" "R" [awareness, sales, wom]
loop B1 "认知饱和回路" "B" [ad_effect, awareness]
